'''Sebastian Giovanni Andre Tretola''' (born May 1, 1992) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[Guard (gridiron football)|guard]] for the [[Tennessee Titans]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Arkansas Razorbacks football|Arkansas Razorbacks]], [[Iowa Western Community College|Iowa Western]], and [[Nevada Wolf Pack football|Nevada Wolf Pack]].<ref>{{Cite news |last=Glennon |first=John |date=April 30, 2016 |title=Titans draft Arkansas G Sebastian Tretola in 6th round |url=http://www.tennessean.com/story/sports/nfl/titans/2016/04/30/titans-draft-tretola-6th-round/83756648/ |access-date=2025-08-14 |work=The Tennessean}}</ref>
